                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex U</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Statement of Roberto.</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Roberto, an Indian, stated that he went with Edgar and Mrs. Renton and the little
                    girl and McCoy to Patook; that they took a pitpan across the lagoon, and walked
                    the rest of the distance. That they left Renton lying wounded in the waika hut.
                    He stated that he saw Mrs. Renton’s wound in the wrist.</p>
            </div>
